DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] 10/19/2026: "Access to Justice: From Classroo
 ms to Courtrooms" to Be Held at the Penobscot Judicial Center on October 2
 0\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Home\nSkip to top navigation\nSkip to side navigation\nSkip to
  content\nSkip to footer\nMaine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp
 \n|\nSearch Maine.gov\nCOURT ALERTS IN EFFECT.\nSee Active Alerts\nHome\n
 →\nNews & Announcements\n"Access to Justice: From Classrooms to Courtroo
 ms" to Be Held at the Penobscot Judicial Center on October 20\, 2026\nDate
 :\n10/19/2026\nAUGUSTA\, Maine. The Maine Judicial Branch\, the University
  of Maine School of Law\, the Maine State Bar Association\, the Penobscot 
 County Bar Association\, the Maine Justice Action Group\, Okun Law Offices
 \, and other partners\, are collaborating on an educational event that wil
 l provide approximately100 students from four eastern Maine high schools w
 ith an engaging learning experience on Maine's justice system and why youn
 g adults should consider a career in public service and/or the legal field
 .\nFor more details about the event\, please see the included event progra
 m.\nRegistration is at capacity for the program. Students from the followi
 ng high schools are participating: Katahdin High School\, Sumner High Scho
 ol\, Foxcroft Academy\, and Orono High School.\nDATE: Tuesday\, October 20
 \, 2026\nPROGRAM TIME: 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m.*\nPLACE: Penobscot Judicial 
 Center\, 78 Exchange Street\, Bangor\, ME 04401\n*Media: Video and photogr
 aphy may be allowed during portions of the event with prior permission. Co
 ntact Barbara Cardone for more information.\nContact: Barbara Cardone\, Es
 q.\nMaine Judicial Branch\, Director of Legal Affairs and Public Relations
  \nPhone: (207) 213-2803\nEmail: barbara.cardone@courts.maine.gov\nSupport
 ing documents\nATJ II press release\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/news/art
 icle.html?id=13363897
URL:https://www.courts.maine.gov/news/article.html?id=13363897
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
