UID:5d532d2dc4b1684c@role-estate-probate.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20261014T213915Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Using the New Call Center Phone Menu
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Using the New Call Center Phone Menu\nUsing the New Cal
 l Center Phone Menu\nOct 14\, 2026\nAs\npreviously communicated\n\, on Oct
 ober 12\, MaineCare launched a new interactive voice response (IVR) system
 \, Gabby\, to enhance the provider self-service experience and help caller
 s to Provider Services access information more quickly and efficiently.\nG
 abby can assist with five common inquiry types:\nClaim Status\nPrior Autho
 rizations\nMember Eligibility\nPayments\nProvider Enrollment\nWhen you cal
 l\, simply tell Gabby which of these topics best matches your reason for c
 alling. Depending on your inquiry\, Gabby will ask for basic information\,
  such as your NPI\, Tax ID\, or a member ID\, to verify your request.\nPle
 ase have this information ready before you call so that you can quickly pr
 ovide it to Gabby. Gabby will prompt multiple times for the information it
  needs to proceed. If you do not provide a valid response\, Gabby will dis
 connect.\nOnce your information is validated\, Gabby will guide you throug
 h additional prompts to help you obtain the information you need.\nIf your
  inquiry is not related to one of the self-service options listed above\, 
 tell Gabby\n"other"\nto connect with a customer service representative for
  further assistance. You can ask to speak to customer service representati
 ve or agent at any time.\nIn addition\, to give providers expanded time fo
 r support\, on Thursday\, October 15\, 2026\, the Call Center will be open
  until 7:00 PM.\nAs a reminder\, in addition to calling Provider Services 
 at\n1-866-690-5585\n\, you can also email\nMaineCareprovider@gainwelltechn
 ologies.com\n. For MaineCare Partner Portal issues\, you can email\nMaineC
 aresupport@gainwelltechnologies.com\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/pro
 viders/provider-bulletins/using-new-call-center-phone-menu-2026-10-14
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/using-new-
 call-center-phone-menu-2026-10-14
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
